  "solution": "Given:\n\n42 - 32 + 62 - 52 + 82 - 72 + ......922 - 912\n\nConcept used:\n\n1. Sum of N natural numbers = N(N + 1)/2\n\n2. A² - B² = (A + B)(A - B)\n\nCalculation:\n\n42 - 32 + 62 - 52 + 82 - 72 + ......922 - 912\n\n⇒ (4 + 3)(4 - 3) + (6 + 5)(6 - 5)+ .... + (92 + 91)(92 - 91)\n\n⇒ (4 + 3) × 1 + (6 + 5) × 1 + .... + (92 + 91) × 1\n\n⇒ 4 + 3 + 6 + 5 + .... + 92 + 91\n\n⇒ 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + .... + 91 + 92\n\n⇒ (1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + .... + 91 + 92) - (1 + 2)\n\n⇒ 92(92 + 1)/2 - 3\n\n⇒ 4275\n\n∴ The required answer is 4275.",
